* **`p14WithI_iruns`**: for every such implementation (`SImplI` on the layer layout), the
  output represents `prop14Proc … (tens Cm) z = Q_p(H0^{⊗D} z)`, disk, error `< √2·2^{-p}`;
  cost `kC (w + 2D) + cWrapE …`.
* **`prop14_il`**: with the recursive `C`-layer `cLayer`, conditional only on the row-addition
  hypothesis `RowHyp` (an `IStmt` code family under the fixed `iprog`) and the gate class.
